4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nQDgs2K8kLYQ7kNvwF2_dZs&_nc_oc=AdoOr7jub816eqHtyOHDxBTs5oXO3eMp3Vy-YUVnvF5xu-4YeaDGlZAOn688f1Ee-OE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af21qeSAvtwOPlZmUKhvQBM7jbk6bxF8r-HEgJK7sPcK9A&oe=69E775D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oIH7tGE9XIMQ7kNvwEHmUix&_nc_oc=AdpN2NJ7d_XAlxV1dh2gMChuA29Fy_vABseF2FKk7aBwWNRrJ2FeZXk-ze2fN2CKy1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0gYiWuFsjQlw7lvNdE_7f9cpohVQXkIZyaE2uRnxTGng&oe=69E77AB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6kj8Fk3jeKkQ7kNvwGEZdLh&_nc_oc=Adr0Jj-Ssol_2v1dbA1LgdV5ws3NM53XXhW1HnkdNq_CswwLr-C6yjohnaET0GUlIRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0dU0Mq9KJ_SLPlKN5LSsDT8wZikrUe0l5AFH6A1V7_Cw&oe=69E78855"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p